Package: ggmtools
Title: Shared Tools for Multiple Gaussian Graphical Model Packages
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Margaret",
           family = "Janiczek",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mjaniczek@umass.edu")
Description: Generics, evaluation metrics and data shared by packages that
    estimate multiple Gaussian graphical models, such as 'spikeyglass' and
    'multiGGMr'. Provides a common long edge-table format with generics to
    extract posterior inclusion probabilities and partial-correlation
    estimates from fitted models, tie-correct ROC curves and AUC, confusion
    metrics at a threshold, conversion of precision matrices to partial
    correlations, and a TCGA breast-cancer PI3K pathway expression dataset.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/mljaniczek/ggmtools
BugReports: https://github.com/mljaniczek/ggmtools/issues
